{"id":"n36672-1-17","stage":1,"title":"공부 · 学习","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36672-1-17-1","ko":"민준이가 그렇게 공부를 잘한다면서요?","zh":"听说敏俊学习那么好啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘한다면서요?","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的内容，连接后文的评论、确认或对照。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8bf08052a5dba490f824.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36672-1-17-2","ko":"네, 책에서 한시도 눈을 안 떼요.","zh":"是的，他一刻都不肯从书本上移开视线。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책에서","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한시도","meaning":"一刻，暂时，片刻","explanation":"한시：一刻，暂时，片刻；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"한시","audio":"/audio/c29c655d5dd44d921374.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85561","senseId":"2","lemma":"한시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈을","meaning":"视线，眼光，看法","explanation":"눈：视线，眼光，看法；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"5","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떼요.","meaning":"转移，转","explanation":"떼다：转移，转；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"떼다","audio":"/audio/8e8c83f0bbe03c0a4ebf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66563","senseId":"4","lemma":"떼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"c29c655d5dd44d92","term":"한시","zh":"一刻，暂时，片刻","audio":"/audio/c29c655d5dd44d921374.mp3","entryId":"85561","definition":"短暂的时间。","pronunciation":["한시"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"视线，眼光，看法","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人们的目光所指向的路线或方向。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc0